  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="86173f49-e23f-584d-887a-945278f8274c" activityNameId="8c1e989f-9f76-5854-afb2-6e284d0db0db" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Discharge, produced water, onshore</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Discharge, produced water, onshore
Emissions related to discharge of produced water;
508d7608-1bf8-3cbd-b985-c838622ea784
Emissions of water pollutants without water content discharged to rivers after treatment. Oil emissions are not included and are considered separately. Water in- and output have to be considered separately.
Location:  Data from literature for offshore production in the North Sea, Indonesia, Mexico , USA and Canada
Technology: Discharge after pre-treatment.
Time period: Time of publications. Most figures could be verified for 2011.
Production volume: About 1m3 of water is discharged per tonne of crude oil produced.
Sampling: Publication in environmental reports and other literature.
Extrapolations: Data from offshore production are applied for global onshore production. Specific measurements for onshore production were not available.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_508d7608-1bf8-3cbd-b985-c838622ea784.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
